DESCRIPTION:DO YOU YEARN? PINING&YEARNING "LOVE WINS"\, an art showcase fac
 ilitated by KIKO&ISIS on October 3rd at 47 Balaclava St\, Woolloongabba 41
 02. This event is 18+\, NO BYO. What should you expect? This night will be
  one full of genuine connection\, self expression\, inevitable soul baring
 \, secret sharing\, prolonged eye contact\, hand holding\, wishful thinkin
 g\, wholehearted yearning-- and most of all\, letting love win. 20+ artist
 s: Cosmikayla\, Bowie D\, Prince&Scribe Studio\, Jude Hodder\, Arion Aimé
 \, Andrew Thompson\, Isabelle Kelleher\, Milan\, Mother Gore\, Poai\, Lili
 th\, JGSVNX\, Slinky\, PlasticFawn\, Stiotyv\, Darcy McGrath\, Tangles\, I
 sis Blue and Holy Person Poetry. 3 musical acts: Platinum Cicadas\, Joseph
 ine Ether\, Clair Wheatley. Interactive Attractions: Live interactive poet
 ry by Lilith\, Scrapbooking workshop by TEG & Life Drawing segment with li
 ve model SJ (hosted by Isis Blue). You're not going to want to miss this. 
 A large portion of the ticket sales will be donated to National Indigenous
  Women’s Resource Center and The Owl & The PussyCat Animal Sanctuary. [b
 utton link="https://events.humanitix.com/p-and-y-love-wins"]Tickets[/butto
 n]
